<$button class="api-summary-btn" set="$:/state/mini-api-milestone-0" setTo="no">
<span class="api-method api-post">post</span>
<span class="api-path">/task-api/tasks/{taskId}/milestones</span>
<span class="api-summary-text">마일스톤 생성</span>
<span class="api-chevron open">▶</span>
</$button></$reveal>
<$reveal state="$:/state/mini-api-milestone-0" type="nomatch" text="yes" default="no" tag="div">
<$button class="api-summary-btn" set="$:/state/mini-api-milestone-0" setTo="yes">
<span class="api-method api-post">post</span>
<span class="api-path">/task-api/tasks/{taskId}/milestones</span>
<span class="api-summary-text">마일스톤 생성</span>
<span class="api-chevron">▶</span>
</$button></$reveal>
<$reveal state="$:/state/mini-api-milestone-0" type="match" text="yes" default="no" class="api-body" tag="div">
<p><strong>헤더</strong><br><code>X-Account-Id: {accountId}</code></p>
<p><strong>설명</strong><br>태스크 1개당 마일스톤 1개를 가질 수 있다. 생성·수정·삭제는 태스크 작성자만 가능하다.</p>
<p><strong>Parameters</strong></p><table>
<tr><th>Name</th><th>In</th><th>Type</th><th>Required</th></tr>
<tr><td>taskId</td><td>path</td><td>Long</td><td>✓</td></tr>
</table>
<p><strong>Request Body</strong></p>
<pre><code>{
  "title": "1차 스프린트",
  "description": "기본 기능 구현",
  "status": "PLANNED",
  "dueDate": "2026-06-01T00:00:00"
}</code></pre>
<table>
<tr><th>필드</th><th>필수</th><th>타입</th><th>설명</th></tr>
<tr><td>title</td><td>O</td><td>String</td><td>마일스톤 제목</td></tr>
<tr><td>description</td><td>X</td><td>String</td><td>마일스톤 설명</td></tr>
<tr><td>status</td><td>O</td><td>MileStoneStatus</td><td>마일스톤 상태</td></tr>
<tr><td>dueDate</td><td>X</td><td>LocalDateTime</td><td>마감일</td></tr>
</table>
<p><strong>Responses</strong></p><div class="api-resp-group">
<span class="api-resp resp-2xx">201</span> 생성 성공 (응답 본문 없음) 
<br>
<span class="api-resp resp-4xx">403</span> 태스크 작성자가 아님 
<br>
</div>
</$reveal>
</div>

