<p><strong>설명</strong><br>요청 본문은 마일스톤 생성과 동일하다.</p>
<p><strong>Parameters</strong></p><table>
<tr><th>Name</th><th>In</th><th>Type</th><th>Required</th></tr>
<tr><td>taskId</td><td>path</td><td>Long</td><td>✓</td></tr>
</table>
